64659752124", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75630198_2577186362552498_3913228803140222976_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J1py221mj0AQ7kNvwHaYb4x&_nc_oc=AdoSJ-jUUqf8oPUBlRldMoBy1Iwt6J5hTODvy9Bm59kjMj-Z_aoisUy_lnqqpKlwbuk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA8f4vVaYBmNhPLE999DeNoCs98LxyadiNnYc42nZ_KxA&oe=6A5F5C5D"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "561784124443343", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75458099_2270787786557926_9182956901405556736_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kr9X4HEwNTAQ7kNvwHSG3Wh&_nc_oc=Adr78rIwZ1upfD_KT9Emqg2iyiyIGq_lcmZ-R7KSuQ3XL0_plldQq2jkKchuV8xW_2k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCnT8miA9vC9txeiwmCbLMSQjd9whPW3j6XlLvqHYH4VQ&oe=6A5F65B7"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "224781318713799", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031393_523290235257100_254597187336404992_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bJVRUtprzTkQ7kNvwG7P3Xm&_nc_oc=Adp4cQ5AuhGKTZ9pDh6UcuU91sE4vAyvvfBTKURuSe5ncyy2C5oHFh4fgBd3j1fl0vM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDsCEfhYD2qL7luoN0oLiWMwWLDQXlMgTXUwMHQRd3gWA&oe=6A5F8B96"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Roller Coaster - Epic Bat Shooting Game", "keywords": ["Epic", "Roller", "Coaster", "Shooting", "Game"], "long_description": "Ready to experience the real adventure of Epic Roller Coaster with a new feature of bat shooting? Indulge in one of the most refined, immersive and energetic VR coasters you\u2019ve ever seen!\nIf you don\u2019t want to go for a most spooky adventure, then you can also enjoy the peaceful ride of Fantasy Roller Coaster! \nThere are 3 modes to have the fun of Epic Roller Coaster:\n1.\tSimple Peaceful Ride\n2.\tHaving Controls on Speed \n3.\tBat Shooting Mode\n\nIf you have any feedback, feel free to share. More and long